# Line endings and diff behaviour.
#
# This is a Windows-only project: a UE4SS C++ mod, PowerShell build/release scripts, an
# HTML install guide a player double-clicks, and config files edited in Notepad. So text
# is normalised to LF in the repository and checked out as CRLF, which is what every
# consumer on this platform expects. Notepad has handled LF since 2018, but the game's
# own tooling and a fair number of editors still do not, and a config file that opens as
# one long line reads as a broken download.
#
# `text=auto` is the safety net: git decides per file whether it is text at all, so a
# binary that slips into a text pattern is still not mangled.

* text=auto eol=crlf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Text, explicitly. Same behaviour as the default above, spelled out so the intent for
# these extensions survives someone narrowing the `*` rule later.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.ps1    text eol=crlf
*.psm1   text eol=crlf
*.cmd    text eol=crlf
*.bat    text eol=crlf
*.html   text eol=crlf
*.htm    text eol=crlf
*.md     text eol=crlf
*.txt    text eol=crlf
*.ini    text eol=crlf
*.cpp    text eol=crlf
*.hpp    text eol=crlf
*.h      text eol=crlf
*.c      text eol=crlf
*.lua    text eol=crlf
*.json   text eol=crlf
*.py     text eol=crlf
*.yml    text eol=crlf
*.yaml   text eol=crlf
*.csv    text eol=crlf
*.def    text eol=crlf
*.gitattributes text eol=crlf
*.gitignore     text eol=crlf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Binary. `-text` means: never run an eol filter, never try to diff or merge as text.
#
# maps/**/*.png is the important one - the shipped map assets are ~42 MB of PNG and are
# irreplaceable without another offline extraction run. sdk/lib/UE4SS.lib is the
# committed import library (see docs/DEVELOPMENT.md).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png    -text
*.jpg    -text
*.jpeg   -text
*.gif    -text
*.webp   -text
*.ico    -text
*.lib    -text
*.dll    -text
*.exe    -text
*.pdb    -text
*.exp    -text
*.zip    -text
*.7z     -text
*.pak    -text
*.ttf    -text
*.otf    -text
*.locres -text

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep generated/vendored code out of the language statistics and collapse it in diffs.
# `linguist-vendored` is GitHub-specific and harmless elsewhere.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
third_party/**  linguist-vendored
sdk/UE4SS.def   linguist-generated
